    <briefdescription>
<para>Serializable representation of stack object from the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1yaml_1_1_machine_frame_info" kindref="compound">MachineFrameInfo</ref> class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The flags &apos;isImmutable&apos; and &apos;isAliased&apos; aren&apos;t serialized, as they are determined by the object&apos;s type and frame information flags. Dead stack objects aren&apos;t serialized.</para>
<para>The &apos;isPreallocated&apos; flag is determined by the local offset. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
